                            <h3>What Are Cookies</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device (computer, tablet, or phone) when you visit a website. They allow the website to recognize your device and remember certain information about your visit.</p>
                        <p>Cookies are widely used to make websites work more efficiently, enhance user experience, and provide analytics data to site owners.</p>
