                        </div>
                        <p>You can control and manage cookies in several ways:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Browser Settings:</strong> Most browsers allow you to view, block, or delete cookies through their settings menus.</li>
                            <li><strong>Opt-Out Tools:</strong> Third-party analytics services may offer opt-out mechanisms for their tracking cookies.</li>
                            <li><strong>Incognito/Private Mode:</strong> Using your browser's private browsing mode will limit how cookies persist after your session ends.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Please note that disabling essential cookies may affect the functionality of CopyQuick and may prevent you from using certain features, including logging in.</p>
